OAuth

Write the story `oauth`: the `User` clicks sign in on the `App`, the `App`
redirects the `User` to the `Identity provider`, the `Identity provider` sends
a code to the `App`, and the `App` trades the code at the `Identity provider`
for a token. Show it as a sequence.
---
story oauth {
  User -> App: sign in
  App -> User: redirect
  User -> Identity provider: log in
  Identity provider -> App: code
  App -> Identity provider: trade code
}
show sequence of oauth
